  "description": "Thirty-five kilometres of the Vltava from Vyšší Brod to Český Krumlov, following the river's mapped centreline downstream — it falls from about 580 m to 485 m. OpenStreetMap carries no rapids grade for this stretch so check water levels and weirs locally before you launch. Two campsites (Minikemp Rožmberk and U Nojdy) and two viewpoints are mapped within 150 m of the river.\n\nRoute data © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). OSM relation/1730536 (way/123694304).\nCover photo: Palickap / CC BY-SA 4.0 / Wikimedia Commons.",
